    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97799" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκί̄ν-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>commotion</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ θερμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					945b9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθος ψυχῆς ς. ἐστίν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					20.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὰ μόρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.19.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>movement in the same direction</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντικίνησις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Corp.Herm.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>.</div>
